{
  "id": "E380",
  "title": "Weird Food in China",
  "level": "advanced",
  "date": "2019-11-19",
  "synopsis": "Paul likes stinky tofu. What kind of Chinese food does he not like?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50380/ab6a9c8bb851f89df1141d22bbe8ff8b0c348072.mp3?1573478555",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "中国的奇怪食物\n\n保罗：附近有一条小吃街，我们去买臭豆腐吃吧。\n小乐：你以前不是很讨厌臭豆腐吗？\n保罗：我尝过了，臭豆腐虽然闻起来很臭，但是吃起来很好吃。\n小乐：哈哈，你现在越来越像中国人了。\n保罗：是啊，不过还有一些奇怪的东西，我真的不敢吃。\n小乐：什么东西？\n保罗：比如说皮蛋。那真的不是坏掉的蛋吗？\n小乐：皮蛋的味道是有点特别，不过加上酱汁后很好吃。下次我用皮蛋做个菜给你尝尝。",
    "traditional": "中國的奇怪食物\n\n保羅：附近有一條小吃街，我們去買臭豆腐吃吧。\n小樂：你以前不是很討厭臭豆腐嗎？\n保羅：我嘗過了，臭豆腐雖然聞起來很臭，但是吃起來很好吃。\n小樂：哈哈，你現在越來越像中國人了。\n保羅：是啊，不過還有一些奇怪的東西，我真的不敢吃。\n小樂：什麼東西？\n保羅：比如說皮蛋。那真的不是壞掉的蛋嗎？\n小樂：皮蛋的味道是有點特別，不過加上醬汁後很好吃。下次我用皮蛋做個菜給你嘗嘗。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Weird Food in China"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：附近有一条小吃街，我们去买臭豆腐吃吧。",
      "traditional": "保羅：附近有一條小吃街，我們去買臭豆腐吃吧。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó fù jìn yǒu yì tiáo xiǎo chī jiē wǒ men qù mǎi chòu dòu fu chī ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: There is a snack street nearby, let’s go and buy some stinky tofu to eat."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：你以前不是很讨厌臭豆腐吗？",
      "traditional": "小樂：你以前不是很討厭臭豆腐嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ yǐ qián bú shì hěn tǎo yàn chòu dòu fu ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Didn’t you really hate stinky tofu before?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：我尝过了，臭豆腐虽然闻起来很臭，但是吃起来很好吃。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我嘗過了，臭豆腐雖然聞起來很臭，但是吃起來很好吃。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ cháng guò le chòu dòu fu suī rán wén qǐ lái hěn chòu dàn shì chī qǐ lái hěn hǎo chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I tried it, and though stinky tofu smells very bad, it still tastes very good when you eat it."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：哈哈，你现在越来越像中国人了。",
      "traditional": "小樂：哈哈，你現在越來越像中國人了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hā hā nǐ xiàn zài yuè lái yuè xiàng zhōng guó rén le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Haha, by now you're getting more and more like a Chinese person."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：是啊，不过还有一些奇怪的东西，我真的不敢吃。",
      "traditional": "保羅：是啊，不過還有一些奇怪的東西，我真的不敢吃。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shì a bú guò hái yǒu yì xiē qí guài de dōng xi wǒ zhēn de bù gǎn chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Yes, but there are still some strange things that I really don’t dare to eat."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小乐：什么东西？",
      "traditional": "小樂：什麼東西？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shén me dōng xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: What things?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "保罗：比如说皮蛋。那真的不是坏掉的蛋吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：比如說皮蛋。那真的不是壞掉的蛋嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó bǐ rú shuō pí dàn nà zhēn de bú shì huài diào de dàn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Century eggs for example. Aren’t they really rotten eggs?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小乐：皮蛋的味道是有点特别，不过加上酱汁后很好吃。",
      "traditional": "小樂：皮蛋的味道是有點特別，不過加上醬汁後很好吃。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè pí dàn de wèi dào shì yǒu diǎn tè bié bú guò jiā shàng jiàng zhī hòu hěn hǎo chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "下次我用皮蛋做个菜给你尝尝。",
      "traditional": "下次我用皮蛋做個菜給你嘗嘗。",
      "pinyin": "xià cì wǒ yòng pí dàn zuò ge cài gěi nǐ cháng cháng",
      "english": "Little Le: The flavor of century eggs is a bit special, but it's very tasty after you add some sauce."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Next time I’ll make a dish with century eggs to give you a taste."
    }
  ],
